<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27385" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλόη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fold, doubling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.710
			</span></i>: but usu., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>porous substance between the double plates in the bones in the
				skull,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.9.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				135
			</span></i>: generally, <i>spongy core</i> of bone, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.77
			</span></i>; also, <i>tissue between layers</i> of intestine, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.9
			</span></i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>weak spot, flaw</i> in metal, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				267e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				71.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.802b
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ δ. τῆς ψυχῆς</span>
			ib. <i><span class="en">
				715f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				441d
			</span></i>; 'patchiness', <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				5.2.1
			</span></i>; also, <i>concealed sense,</i> in oracles, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.407c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>hollow sting</i> of the scorpion, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				9.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
